WEBVTT

00:08.931 --> 00:09.931
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.034 --> 00:12.068
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.172 --> 00:13.310
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.413 --> 00:14.586
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.689 --> 00:17.137
♪ Oh...
♪ 哦...

00:17.241 --> 00:20.275
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.379 --> 00:21.482
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:21.586 --> 00:23.793
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he. ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 ♪

00:23.896 --> 00:25.172
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:25.275 --> 00:28.379
♪ If nautical nonsense be
something you wish... ♪
♪ 如果航海方面的废话是
你想要的东西...♪

00:28.482 --> 00:29.758
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:29.862 --> 00:32.379
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish. ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通。 ♪

00:32.482 --> 00:34.206
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:34.310 --> 00:36.275
♪ Ready?
SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 准备好了吗？
海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:36.379 --> 00:39.275
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:39.379 --> 00:40.241
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:40.344 --> 00:42.793
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:45.137 --> 00:48.758
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部

00:48.862 --> 00:52.206
[and NICKELODEON]
[和尼克频道]

01:04.068 --> 01:05.241
Here you go, sir.
给你，先生。

01:05.344 --> 01:09.344
A King Size
Ultra Krabby Supreme
with the works
特大号
超级蟹蟹至尊
与作品

01:09.448 --> 01:12.517
double batter-fried on a stick.
双面糊炸在棍子上。

01:12.620 --> 01:14.310
Thanks!
谢谢！

01:14.413 --> 01:15.413
Barnacle head.
藤壶头。

01:15.448 --> 01:16.241
Pardon me?
对不起？

01:16.344 --> 01:17.424
You forgot your mayonnaise.
你忘记带蛋黄酱了。

01:17.482 --> 01:19.620
Thanks.
谢谢。

01:20.931 --> 01:24.344
Look at them eating
that garbage.
看他们吃饭的样子
那个垃圾。

01:24.448 --> 01:26.482
It's disgusting.
那真令人恶心。

01:26.586 --> 01:29.034
They're sickening.
他们真令人作呕。

01:29.137 --> 01:30.551
I hate Krabby Patties.
我讨厌蟹肉饼。

01:33.517 --> 01:34.758
Good one, Squidward!
好样的，章鱼哥！

01:34.862 --> 01:35.758
Good what?
好什么？

01:35.862 --> 01:37.379
Like you don't know.
就像你不知道一样。

01:37.482 --> 01:39.758
Saying "I hate Krabby Patties."
说“我讨厌蟹黄馅饼”。

01:39.862 --> 01:40.758
That's hilarious!
太搞笑了！

01:40.862 --> 01:43.137
Everyone loves Krabby Patties.
每个人都喜欢蟹黄馅饼。

01:43.241 --> 01:45.344
Yeah, well, not me.
是的，好吧，不是我。

01:46.103 --> 01:47.965
You're good at that.
你很擅长这个。

01:48.068 --> 01:49.172
Hey, everyone!
嘿，大家好！

01:49.275 --> 01:52.931
Squid says he doesn't
like Krabby Patties. Ha!
鱿鱼说他没有
像蟹黄饼一样。哈!

01:54.620 --> 01:56.620
Good one, Squidward!
好样的，章鱼哥！

01:57.758 --> 01:58.827
Don't encourage them!
不要鼓励他们！

01:58.931 --> 01:59.931
They'll never leave.
他们永远不会离开。

02:00.034 --> 02:01.103
Sorry, Squidward.
对不起，章鱼哥。

02:01.206 --> 02:02.551
It's just so funny.
真是太有趣了。

02:02.655 --> 02:03.931
You know what we say:
你知道我们说什么：

02:04.034 --> 02:08.137
The only people
who don't like a Krabby Patty
唯一的人
谁不喜欢蟹肉饼

02:08.241 --> 02:09.517
have never tasted one.
从未尝过。

02:09.620 --> 02:11.241
That's me.
这就是我。

02:11.344 --> 02:14.137
Never had one, never will.
从来没有过，也永远不会。

02:15.517 --> 02:16.896
What?
什么？

02:17.000 --> 02:17.620
What?
什么？

02:17.724 --> 02:18.517
What did you say?
你说什么？

02:18.620 --> 02:20.068
I've never had a Krabby Patty
我从来没有吃过蟹肉饼

02:20.172 --> 02:20.862
and never will.
并且永远不会。

02:20.965 --> 02:22.000
I'm sorry... I don't...
对不起...我不...

02:22.103 --> 02:24.620
I've never had a Krabby Patty.
我从来没有吃过蟹肉饼。

02:24.724 --> 02:25.448
Those words!
那些话！

02:25.551 --> 02:26.793
Is it possible to use them
可以使用它们吗

02:26.896 --> 02:29.068
in a sentence
together like that?
造句
就这样在一起？

02:29.172 --> 02:32.827
I've never had a Krabby Patty!
I've never had a Krabby Patty!
I've never had a Krabby Patty!
我从来没有吃过蟹肉饼！
我从来没有吃过蟹肉饼！
我从来没有吃过蟹肉饼！

02:32.931 --> 02:34.034
Never had a Krabby Patty?
从来没有吃过蟹黄饼？

02:34.137 --> 02:36.206
Well, you've gotta have one
right now!
那么，你必须拥有一个
现在！

02:36.310 --> 02:38.620
No wonder you're
always so miserable!
难怪你是
总是这么惨！

02:38.724 --> 02:39.517
Here, try this!
来，试试这个！

02:39.620 --> 02:40.896
Get that garbage outta my face!
把那些垃圾从我脸上拿走！

02:41.000 --> 02:43.655
If you try it, you'll love it!
如果您尝试一下，您一定会喜欢的！

02:43.758 --> 02:47.034
Try one of those radioactive
sludge balls you call food?
尝试其中一种放射性物质
你称之为食物的污泥球？

02:47.137 --> 02:51.827
Next I suppose you'll want me to
go square-dancing with Patrick.
接下来我想你会希望我这样做
和帕特里克一起去跳广场舞。

02:51.931 --> 02:53.413
Sorry, Patrick.
对不起，帕特里克。

02:54.275 --> 02:55.896
Come on, you're gonna...
来吧，你会...

02:56.000 --> 02:56.862
No.
不。

02:56.965 --> 02:57.965
Open up the tunnel.
打开隧道。

02:58.068 --> 02:58.551
Here comes the train.
火车来了。

02:58.655 --> 03:00.517
Choo-choo...
咕咕...

03:00.620 --> 03:01.448
No!
不！

03:01.551 --> 03:03.103
Whoop! What's that
in your ear?
哎哟！那是什么
在你耳边？

03:03.206 --> 03:03.931
Quit it.
戒掉吧。

03:04.034 --> 03:05.137
Come on, open wide!
来吧，敞开心扉！

03:05.241 --> 03:07.000
SpongeBob, if I were trapped
海绵宝宝，如果我被困了

03:07.103 --> 03:10.000
at the bottom of a
well for three years
在 a 的底部
三年了

03:10.103 --> 03:13.103
with nothing to eat
but that Krabby Patty
没有东西吃
但那个蟹蟹帕蒂

03:13.206 --> 03:14.965
I'd eat my own legs first!
我先吃自己的腿！

03:15.068 --> 03:16.862
And not just the extra ones.
不仅仅是额外的。

03:16.965 --> 03:18.034
But it's good for you!
但这对你有好处！

03:18.137 --> 03:19.137
Good for you?
对你有好处？

03:19.241 --> 03:20.389
That thing is a heart attack
on a bun!
那是心脏病发作
在一个小圆面包上！

03:20.413 --> 03:26.172
No, Squidward, I meant...
good for your soul.
不，章鱼哥，我的意思是……
对你的灵魂有好处。

03:27.137 --> 03:30.310
Oh, puh-leez! I have no soul.
哦，噗噗！我没有灵魂。

03:34.655 --> 03:35.689
Okay, just half.
好吧，就一半。

03:35.793 --> 03:36.655
No.
不。

03:36.758 --> 03:37.758
A quarter?
四分之一？

03:37.793 --> 03:38.655
No.
不。

03:38.758 --> 03:40.448
One bite?
一口？

03:41.275 --> 03:42.275
Just smell it.
闻一下就知道了。

03:42.310 --> 03:43.931
If I didn't want it out there
如果我不想让它在那里

03:44.034 --> 03:46.068
what makes you think I'd find it
是什么让你认为我会找到它

03:46.172 --> 03:48.379
more appealing in here?!
这里更有吸引力？！

03:48.896 --> 03:50.413
Come on, Squidward.
来吧，章鱼哥。

03:50.517 --> 03:51.827
No.
不。

03:53.793 --> 03:54.931
One bite.
咬一口。

03:55.034 --> 03:55.724
No.
不。

03:55.827 --> 03:57.448
You won't be sorry.
你不会后悔的。

03:57.551 --> 03:59.206
No!
不！

03:59.310 --> 04:00.620
It's delicious...
真好吃...

04:00.724 --> 04:03.827
SpongeBob, how long are you
prepared to keep this up?
海绵宝宝，你还有多久
准备好继续这样下去了吗？

04:06.793 --> 04:08.827
Give me that!
给我那个！

04:08.931 --> 04:13.172
When I die... you stay
away from my funeral.
当我死后...你留下来
远离我的葬礼。

04:13.758 --> 04:16.620
Ohh... do I really...
哦...我真的...

04:16.724 --> 04:19.724
Ah...
啊...

04:20.655 --> 04:23.758
Ooh...
哦...

04:24.379 --> 04:26.413
Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh...
噢噢噢噢...

04:36.448 --> 04:41.586
Why... this Krabby Patty
may be the most...
为什么……这个蟹肉饼
可能是最...

04:41.689 --> 04:43.655
Horrible!
可怕！

04:43.758 --> 04:44.758
Putrid!
腐烂！

04:44.793 --> 04:46.827
Poorly prepared!
Vile!
准备不充分！
卑鄙！

04:46.931 --> 04:47.724
Unappetizing!
没有胃口！

04:47.827 --> 04:50.172
Disgusting excuse for a sandwich
三明治的恶心借口

04:50.275 --> 04:52.517
it has ever been my displeasure
这一直是我的不满

04:52.620 --> 04:55.448
to have slither down my throat!
滑进我的喉咙！

04:55.551 --> 04:56.344
But..
但..

04:56.448 --> 04:58.551
And I curse this Krabby Patty
我诅咒这个蟹黄派蒂

04:58.655 --> 05:01.896
and all who enjoy them
to an early
以及所有喜欢它们的人
到早

05:02.000 --> 05:05.931
and well-deserved grave!
当之无愧的坟墓！

05:06.689 --> 05:07.551
Get it?
得到它？

05:07.655 --> 05:09.275
But it doesn't make any sense
但这没有任何意义

05:09.379 --> 05:11.689
The Krabby Patty
is an absolute good.
蟹肉饼
是绝对的好。

05:11.793 --> 05:13.724
Nobody is immune
to its tasty charms.
没有人能免疫
其美味的魅力。

05:13.827 --> 05:15.758
Nobody but me.
除了我之外没有人。

05:15.862 --> 05:16.965
Are you sure?
你确定吗？

05:17.068 --> 05:20.275
Does this look unsure to you?
这对你来说看起来不确定吗？

05:21.275 --> 05:22.137
No.
不。

05:22.241 --> 05:22.931
Good!
好的！

05:23.034 --> 05:24.896
Now go spread the word.
现在就去宣传吧。

05:31.275 --> 05:34.448
Come on! Come on!
Come on! Come on!
快点！快点！
快点！快点！

05:34.551 --> 05:35.172
Ah...
啊...

05:35.275 --> 05:38.275
Still alive!
还活着！

05:40.827 --> 05:43.413
Oh, so delicious!
哦，真好吃！

05:44.275 --> 05:45.862
Oh...! The wasted years!
哦...！荒废的岁月！

05:51.310 --> 05:56.000
I got to have more.
I got to have more!
我必须拥有更多。
我必须要更多！

05:58.586 --> 05:59.965
But wait!
但是等等！

06:00.586 --> 06:01.689
After that performance
那次表演之后

06:01.793 --> 06:03.310
he'd never let me live it down!
他永远不会让我失望！

06:03.413 --> 06:05.689
I gotta sneak one, just one...
我得偷偷拿一张，就一张……

06:05.793 --> 06:08.275
then I'm off the stuff for good!
那我就永远摆脱这些东西了！

06:08.379 --> 06:09.758
I didn't think it was possible
我不认为这是可能的

06:09.862 --> 06:13.793
but I guess some people
just don't like Krabby Patties!
但我猜有些人
只是不喜欢蟹肉饼！

06:20.931 --> 06:22.068
Uh, SpongeBob?
呃，海绵宝宝？

06:22.172 --> 06:23.379
Yes, Squidward?
是的，章鱼哥？

06:23.482 --> 06:26.172
I need a Triple Krabby Supreme
on a kelp bun
我需要三重蟹黄至尊
放在海带面包上

06:26.275 --> 06:30.896
with extra sea pickle and,
and burn it to a crisp, okay?
加上额外的海泡菜，
然后把它烧得酥脆，好吗？

06:31.000 --> 06:32.827
Coming right up!
马上就来了！

06:32.931 --> 06:33.724
Listen, Squidward.
听着，章鱼哥。

06:33.827 --> 06:35.206
I want to apologize for before.
我想为之前的事情道歉。

06:35.310 --> 06:38.586
I was only trying
to make you happy.
我只是想尝试
让你开心。

06:43.620 --> 06:44.655
But now I've learned
但现在我已经学会了

06:44.758 --> 06:46.278
there's room for
all kinds of people...
有空间
各种各样的人...

06:48.137 --> 06:52.896
and they don't
all have to like
the same things.
他们不
都必须喜欢
同样的事情。

06:54.793 --> 06:55.482
Don't go.
别走。

06:55.586 --> 06:56.379
While I strongly disagree
虽然我强烈不同意

06:56.482 --> 06:57.700
with your decision, I accept it.
你的决定，我接受。

06:57.724 --> 07:02.206
You know, it's not often
I get to make one like this.
你知道，这样的情况并不常见
我要做一个这样的。

07:02.310 --> 07:04.517
I want to see the look
on their face
我想看看样子
在他们的脸上

07:04.620 --> 07:06.689
when they take that first bite.
当他们咬第一口时。

07:07.103 --> 07:09.586
Triple Krabby Supreme!
三重蟹蟹至尊！

07:09.689 --> 07:10.724
Triple Krabby Supreme!
三重蟹蟹至尊！

07:10.827 --> 07:14.586
Did somebody order
a Triple Krabby Supreme?
有人订购了吗
三重蟹黄至尊？

07:14.689 --> 07:15.931
Huh? They must have left.
啊？他们一定已经离开了。

07:16.034 --> 07:19.344
Well, uh, why don't you
just uh, leave it out here
嗯，呃，你为什么不呢
只是呃，把它留在这里

07:19.448 --> 07:20.724
in case they come back.
万一他们回来了。

07:20.827 --> 07:23.655
Nope, a patty this special
should be eaten fresh
不，这么特别的肉饼
应该新鲜吃

07:23.758 --> 07:27.000
and... well... I haven't
had one of these babies
而且...好吧...我还没有
有这些婴儿之一

07:27.103 --> 07:28.724
in over 20 minutes so...
20多分钟后...

07:31.034 --> 07:34.379
Well, whoever they were,
they had great taste!
好吧，无论他们是谁，
他们的品味很好！

07:36.275 --> 07:39.689
Mm, mm-hmm-hmm,
mm-hmm-hmm-hmm...
嗯，嗯嗯嗯，
嗯嗯嗯嗯……

07:40.586 --> 07:44.344
Ah, they don't know
what they're missing.
啊，他们不知道
他们缺少什么。

07:44.448 --> 07:45.551
Well, back to work.
好吧，回去工作吧。

07:45.655 --> 07:46.413
What do I have to do?
我必须做什么？

07:46.517 --> 07:48.758
Eat one out of the garbage?
从垃圾堆里吃一个？

07:48.862 --> 07:52.896
I wish I could eat this,
but I'm so darn full.
我希望我能吃这个
但我实在是太饱了。

07:53.000 --> 07:55.517
Oh well.
那好吧。

07:55.620 --> 07:59.448
I had to say garbage...
but okay!
不得不说垃圾...
但好吧！

08:08.310 --> 08:09.655
Bleah...
布莱亚...

08:12.275 --> 08:14.413
Oh no, what's this doing here?
哦不，这是在做什么？

08:14.517 --> 08:16.655
This patty should be cremated!
这个肉饼应该火化！

08:21.206 --> 08:23.551
I know you didn't like him
我知道你不喜欢他

08:23.655 --> 08:27.310
but it means so much
that you came.
但这意义重大
你来了。

08:52.413 --> 08:54.413
Honey?
蜂蜜？

08:54.517 --> 08:55.620
What? Oh...
什么？哦...

08:55.724 --> 08:59.379
I have got to get my hands
on a Krabby Patty!
我必须抓住我的手
在蟹肉饼上！

08:59.482 --> 09:01.448
And no one's going to stop me.
没有人会阻止我。

09:08.517 --> 09:10.586
There it is...
那里是……

09:18.655 --> 09:19.413
Holy shrimp!
圣虾！

09:19.517 --> 09:21.724
I don't know where to start.
我不知道从哪里开始。

09:21.827 --> 09:23.620
All that matters is that
重要的是

09:23.724 --> 09:26.724
it's just you... and me...
and nobody...
只有你...和我...
and nobody...

09:26.827 --> 09:28.241
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

09:28.344 --> 09:29.517
Is that you?
那是你吗？

09:29.620 --> 09:30.689
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

09:30.793 --> 09:33.689
Uh, uh, uh...
what are you doing here?
呃呃呃……
你在这里做什么？

09:33.793 --> 09:36.379
I always come to work
at 3:00 a.m.
我总是来上班
凌晨 3:00

09:36.482 --> 09:38.413
This is when I count
the sesame seeds.
这是我数数的时候
芝麻。

09:38.517 --> 09:39.620
What are you doing here?
你在这里做什么？

09:39.724 --> 09:41.241
Uh... I forgot my...
呃……我忘了我的……

09:41.344 --> 09:43.241
And why is the patty vault open?
为什么馅饼金库是开放的？

09:43.344 --> 09:45.827
And why are you holding
a patty behind your back?
你为什么持有
背后有小馅饼吗？

09:45.931 --> 09:48.275
I... I... I...
no, I didn't do...
我...我...我...
不，我没有做...

09:48.379 --> 09:49.562
And why are you
acting so nervous?
而你为什么是
表现得这么紧张？

09:49.586 --> 09:52.517
And why are you
sweating so much?
而你为什么是
出这么多汗？

09:52.620 --> 09:55.551
And why do you look so hungry?
还有你为什么看起来这么饿？

09:55.655 --> 09:57.586
No, wait... it's
not what you think.
不，等等……这是
不是你想的那样。

09:57.689 --> 09:59.517
Th-this is a big
misunderstanding.
Th-这是一个大
误解。

09:59.620 --> 10:01.275
You've got to believe me, I...
你一定要相信我，我...

10:01.379 --> 10:02.517
Listen, I am telling you...
听着，我告诉你……

10:02.620 --> 10:04.172
You better listen
to me, SpongeBob.
你最好听听
对我来说，海绵宝宝。

10:04.275 --> 10:08.517
You like Krabby Patties,
don't you, Squidward?
你喜欢蟹黄饼，
不是吗，章鱼哥？

10:08.965 --> 10:13.448
Yes! Yes! I admit it, SpongeBob!
是的！是的！我承认，海绵宝宝！

10:13.551 --> 10:17.103
I loveKrabby Patties!
我喜欢蟹黄馅饼！

10:18.000 --> 10:19.896
I knew it all along, Squidward.
我一直都知道，章鱼哥。

10:20.000 --> 10:21.344
No one can resist
a Krabby Patty.
无人能抗拒
蟹肉饼。

10:31.620 --> 10:34.137
Squidward!
How many are you eating?
章鱼哥！
你吃几个？

10:34.241 --> 10:35.241
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

10:42.827 --> 10:48.137
Squidward, you can't eat
all those patties at one time!
章鱼哥，你不能吃
一次性所有这些肉饼！

10:48.241 --> 10:49.655
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

10:49.758 --> 10:51.206
What's gonna happen?
会发生什么？

10:51.310 --> 10:52.793
Am I gonna blow up?
我会爆炸吗？

10:52.896 --> 10:57.137
No, worse... it'll go
right to your thighs...
不，更糟的是……它会消失
一直到你的大腿...

10:57.241 --> 10:58.655
My thighs?
我的大腿？

10:58.758 --> 11:01.137
And then you'll blow up.
然后你就会爆炸。

11:06.620 --> 11:08.793
Yeah...
是的...

11:08.896 --> 11:12.655
I remember my first
Krabby Patty.
我记得我的第一次
克拉比·帕蒂。

11:55.103 --> 11:56.103
Excuse me, Miss.
对不起，小姐。

11:56.137 --> 11:57.631
I don't want to have
to report you again.
我不想拥有
再次举报您。

11:57.655 --> 11:59.103
I was just wondering....
我只是想知道......

11:59.206 --> 12:02.620
Is it the "homework pencil"
on the left side of the paper
这是“作业铅笔”吗？
在纸的左侧

12:02.724 --> 12:04.000
next to the "quiz pencil"
在“测验铅笔”旁边

12:04.103 --> 12:06.241
or over on the right side,
all by itself... or...
或者在右侧，
一切都靠它自己……或者……

12:06.344 --> 12:08.379
I think it goes
stuck inside your...
我认为可以
困在你的...

12:08.482 --> 12:09.482
Wait! I got it!
等待！我得到了它！

12:09.551 --> 12:11.344
The "quiz pencil"
goes right over here
“测验铅笔”
就到这里

12:11.448 --> 12:12.620
next to the "essay" pencil.
在“论文”铅笔旁边。

12:12.724 --> 12:14.551
And the "essay" pencil
gets turned sideways
还有“论文”铅笔
被转向一边

12:14.655 --> 12:15.724
towards the notepad.
向记事本。

12:15.827 --> 12:17.413
Just in case
I have to write an essay.
以防万一
我必须写一篇论文。

12:17.517 --> 12:19.172
Good morning, class!
早上好，同学们！

12:19.275 --> 12:20.586
Sorry I'm late...
抱歉我来晚了...

12:20.689 --> 12:22.241
I got caught in traffic
on the way here
我陷入交通堵塞
在来这里的路上

12:22.344 --> 12:25.758
when that whole
"I'm gonna be doing this
for the rest of my life" thing
当整个
“我要做这个
在我的余生中”的事情

12:25.862 --> 12:26.862
reared its ugly head
抬起丑陋的头

12:26.896 --> 12:28.068
and I...
而我...

12:28.172 --> 12:31.482
Anyway, we have a new student
starting today.
无论如何，我们有一个新学生
从今天开始。

12:31.586 --> 12:34.862
So let's all put on a happy face
所以让我们都露出幸福的表情

12:34.965 --> 12:37.241
for Flats the Flounder.
对于平底鲽鱼。

12:39.896 --> 12:41.736
Tell the class something
about yourself, Flats.
告诉全班同学一些事情
关于你自己，弗拉茨。

12:41.827 --> 12:46.206
Well, I like to
kick people's butts.
嗯，我喜欢
踢人们的屁股。

12:48.758 --> 12:49.793
What a card.
多么好的一张卡片啊。

12:49.896 --> 12:51.827
Now, Flats, it's time
to pick your seat.
现在，平底斯，是时候了
选择你的座位。

12:51.931 --> 12:55.896
Just go ahead
and sit anywhere you like.
继续吧
然后坐在你喜欢的任何地方。

12:57.965 --> 13:01.827
Okay, class,
as you remember last week...
好的，上课，
正如你记得上周...

13:01.931 --> 13:04.482
Hi, I'm SpongeBob.
嗨，我是海绵宝宝。

13:04.586 --> 13:05.896
Hi, SpongeBob.
嗨，海绵宝宝。

13:06.000 --> 13:08.172
I'm gonna kick your butt.
我要踢你的屁股。

13:08.275 --> 13:09.275
Whoa!
哇！

13:10.413 --> 13:13.206
That joke was almost
funnier the second time.
那个笑话几乎是
第二次就更搞笑了

13:13.310 --> 13:15.000
No... I mean it.
不……我是说真的。

13:15.103 --> 13:19.931
That time
it almost seemed like...
那个时候
几乎看起来就像...

13:21.413 --> 13:24.310
you did mean it.
你确实是这么想的。

13:24.413 --> 13:25.241
Mrs. Puff.
泡芙女士。

13:25.344 --> 13:26.344
Yes, SpongeBob?
是的，海绵宝宝？

13:26.413 --> 13:28.206
Can I be excused
for the rest of my life?
我可以原谅吗
我的余生？

13:28.310 --> 13:29.517
Why no, SpongeBob.
为什么不呢，海绵宝宝。

13:29.620 --> 13:32.655
I'm in the middle of a coffee-
fueled sermon right now.
我正在喝咖啡-
现在为讲道加油。

13:32.758 --> 13:36.724
You can't afford
to miss this information.
你买不起
错过这个信息。

13:36.827 --> 13:38.793
Yes, Mrs.Puff.
是的，帕夫夫人。

13:38.896 --> 13:41.103
Sorry, Mrs. Puff.
对不起，帕芙女士。

13:41.206 --> 13:43.931
Now... can I please
have a volunteer
现在...我可以吗
有一名志愿者

13:44.034 --> 13:45.758
to come up to the board?
进入董事会？

13:45.862 --> 13:48.103
How about you, Flats?
你呢，弗拉茨？

13:48.206 --> 13:49.286
Please draw for us a diagram
请给我们画个图

13:49.310 --> 13:52.620
of a basic four-way
intersection, Flats.
基本四路的
交叉路口，平地。

13:55.827 --> 13:57.310
Please turn and show the class
请转身给全班同学展示

13:57.413 --> 14:00.482
what you drew, honey.
你画的是什么，亲爱的。

14:03.172 --> 14:05.655
My!
How very creative!
我的！
多么有创意啊！

14:05.758 --> 14:08.620
We have an artist in the class!
我们班上有一位艺术家！

14:16.137 --> 14:18.103
I just don't understand.
我只是不明白。

14:18.206 --> 14:19.724
Why would Flats
want to kick mybutt?
为什么要平底鞋
想踢我的屁股吗？

14:19.827 --> 14:23.896
I haven't said
two words to the guy!
我还没说过
对那家伙说两句话！

14:24.000 --> 14:26.586
Hi, I'm SpongeBob.
嗨，我是海绵宝宝。

14:26.689 --> 14:28.448
One... two...
一……二……

14:28.551 --> 14:29.724
Oh no, that's three!
哦不，是三个！

14:29.827 --> 14:31.034
What am I gonna do?
我要做什么？

14:32.034 --> 14:34.379
What's that?! Someone's coming.
那是什么？有人来了。

14:34.482 --> 14:35.172
They're getting closer.
他们越来越近了。

14:35.275 --> 14:37.344
I just got to act natural.
我只需要表现得自然就好。

14:40.551 --> 14:42.862
Oh, that's real nice.
哦，那真是太好了。

14:44.344 --> 14:47.172
Whew!
I thought for sure
that was gonna be...
哇！
我确信无疑
那将会是...

14:47.275 --> 14:48.896
Flats?!
公寓？！

14:49.000 --> 14:50.517
Uh, hello, um... sir.
呃，你好，嗯……先生。

14:50.620 --> 14:53.379
Uh... kicked any
good butts lately?
呃……踢过任何一个
最近屁股好吗？

14:53.482 --> 14:54.522
Yeah, I remember last week
是的，我记得上周

14:54.551 --> 14:57.793
I was kickin' this
guy's butt real good...
我正在踢这个
这家伙的屁股真好……

14:57.896 --> 14:59.275
and he leans over and says...
他倾身说道……

14:59.379 --> 15:02.206
"Hey, ya know... life's like
a bucket of wood shavings,
“嘿，你知道……生活就像
一桶木屑，

15:02.310 --> 15:04.551
"except for when the shavings
are in a pail...
“除了当刨花
在桶里...

15:04.655 --> 15:08.000
then it's like a pail
of wood shavings."
然后它就像一个桶
木屑。”

15:08.103 --> 15:10.448
Hey, that story
really speaks to me.
嘿，那个故事
真的对我说话。

15:10.551 --> 15:11.689
Really? What's it say?
真的吗？它说什么？

15:11.793 --> 15:14.896
It says now I'm gonna
kick your butt twice as hard.
它说现在我要
加倍用力踢屁股。

15:15.000 --> 15:17.000
It says now I'm gonna
kick your butt twice as hard.
它说现在我要
加倍用力踢屁股。

15:19.344 --> 15:21.758
And I'll leave
Gary's water bowl to Gary
我会离开
加里的水碗给加里

15:21.862 --> 15:22.896
and my curtains to...
还有我的窗帘...

15:23.000 --> 15:24.724
Oh, Neptune,
I just can't do this!
哦，海王星，
我就是做不到！

15:28.137 --> 15:29.389
Death row.
"Next-in-line" speaking.
死囚牢房。
“下一个”讲话。

15:29.413 --> 15:33.827
Hi! I'd like to place
an order for delivery.
你好！我想放置
交货订单。

15:33.931 --> 15:36.344
Patrick! Is that you?
帕特里克！那是你吗？

15:36.448 --> 15:37.517
Yeah. Hey, Mario.
是的。嘿，马里奥。

15:37.620 --> 15:39.862
Let me get a large,
double olive, double...
让我来一个大的，
双橄榄，双...

15:39.965 --> 15:42.517
Patrick, listen!
It's me, SpongeBob!
帕特里克，听着！
是我，海绵宝宝！

15:42.620 --> 15:44.275
I need your help.
我需要你的帮助。

15:44.379 --> 15:46.689
You're working
at Pizza Castle now?
你正在工作
现在在披萨城堡吗？

15:46.793 --> 15:48.827
What? No... listen!
什么？不……听着！

15:48.931 --> 15:50.344
I'm in big trouble.
我有大麻烦了。

15:50.448 --> 15:53.275
There's a new guy at school here
and he wants kick my butt.
学校来了一个新同学
他想踢我的屁股。

15:53.379 --> 15:54.389
Listen, you're big and strong.
听着，你又大又壮。

15:54.413 --> 15:56.379
Do you think
you can come down here...
你认为
你可以到这里来...

15:56.482 --> 16:00.275
maybe rough him up a bit,
just to get him off my back?
也许对他有点粗暴，
只是为了让他离开我的背吗？

16:00.379 --> 16:01.517
Please, Patrick!
拜托，帕特里克！

16:01.620 --> 16:04.620
I'm so scared it feels
like I'm gonna throw up.
我很害怕这种感觉
就像我要吐一样。

16:04.724 --> 16:06.517
No, they're not closed...
不，他们没有关门……

16:06.620 --> 16:08.034
I know, you want olives...
我知道，你想要橄榄...

16:08.137 --> 16:08.793
Patrick? You there?
帕特里克？你在那里？

16:08.896 --> 16:11.172
Oh, I'm sorry, SpongeBob.
哦，对不起，海绵宝宝。

16:11.275 --> 16:14.275
I was just talking
to my old community
college buddy, Flats.
我只是在说话
到我的老社区
大学好友，平底鞋。

16:14.379 --> 16:18.137
I bumped into him
at the soda store,
isn't that funny?
我撞到了他
在汽水店，
这不是很有趣吗？

16:18.241 --> 16:21.862
It must have been years
since we've seen each other.
一定已经很多年了
自从我们见面以来。

16:21.965 --> 16:23.068
Well, let me get going.
好吧，让我走吧。

16:23.172 --> 16:25.103
He's got to go
back to school soon.
他得走了
很快就回学校了。

16:25.206 --> 16:28.241
He says he's got to
kick somebody's butt.
他说他必须
踢某人的屁股。

16:28.344 --> 16:30.275
Aah...!
啊啊……！

16:30.379 --> 16:32.310
Hello?
Is this Pizza Castle?
你好？
这是披萨城堡吗？

16:32.413 --> 16:36.137
Aah...!
啊啊……！

16:36.241 --> 16:38.689
Come in, SpongeBob.
进来吧，海绵宝宝。

16:41.689 --> 16:45.206
Mrs. Puff, can I be
in a different class?
泡芙女士，我可以吗
在不同的班级？

16:45.310 --> 16:45.931
But why?
但为什么？

16:46.034 --> 16:47.551
I can't tell you.
我不能告诉你。

16:47.655 --> 16:48.896
Why ever not?
为什么从来没有？

16:49.000 --> 16:50.275
I just can't, Mrs. Puff.
我就是做不到，帕芙女士。

16:50.379 --> 16:52.241
My physical being is at stake.
我的身体受到威胁。

16:52.344 --> 16:53.931
Let's just leave it at that.
我们就这样吧。

16:54.034 --> 16:56.793
SpongeBob,
you can tell me anything.
海绵宝宝，
你可以告诉我任何事情。

16:56.896 --> 16:59.310
You've got to believe that.
你必须相信这一点。

16:59.413 --> 17:00.517
Well... okay.
嗯……好吧。

17:00.620 --> 17:03.586
But only if you promise
to keep it between us.
但前提是你答应了
把它保留在我们之间。

17:03.689 --> 17:04.586
Of course.
当然。

17:04.689 --> 17:06.049
Flats says
he's gonna kick my butt!
平底鞋说
他会踢我的屁股！

17:06.103 --> 17:10.103
What?! There shall be
no butt-kicking
什么？！应有
没有踢屁股

17:10.206 --> 17:11.827
in any class of mine.
在我的任何班级。

17:11.931 --> 17:13.965
This is an adult program.
这是一个成人节目。

17:14.068 --> 17:16.689
SpongeBob, just leave it to me.
海绵宝宝，交给我吧。

17:16.793 --> 17:18.206
Aw, thanks, Mrs. Puff.
哦，谢谢，帕芙女士。

17:18.310 --> 17:20.241
I knew I could count on you.
我知道我可以依靠你。

17:23.448 --> 17:24.562
Have a nice lunch, SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝，午餐愉快吗？

17:24.586 --> 17:26.344
Yes, Mrs. Puff.
是的，帕夫夫人。

17:26.448 --> 17:27.758
Psst! SpongeBob!
嘘！海绵宝宝！

17:27.862 --> 17:30.551
I talked to Flats for you.
我替你和弗拉茨谈过了。

17:30.655 --> 17:31.689
I used your name.
我用了你的名字。

17:31.793 --> 17:33.896
It was all a misunderstanding.
这一切都是一场误会。

17:34.000 --> 17:35.137
You what?!
你什么？！

17:35.241 --> 17:36.320
He was never going to
kick your butt at all.
他从来没有打算
踢你的屁股。

17:36.344 --> 17:40.206
You see, SpongeBob,
Flats is from a town
你看，海绵宝宝，
Flats来自一个城镇

17:40.310 --> 17:42.344
where "kicking someone's butt"
哪里“踢某人的屁股”

17:42.448 --> 17:45.586
means that he wants
to be your friend
意味着他想要
成为你的朋友

17:45.689 --> 17:47.034
and maybe play
也许可以玩

17:47.137 --> 17:47.965
some sports with you
on weekends. and maybe play
和你一起做一些运动
周末。也许可以玩

17:48.068 --> 17:49.413
some sports with you
on weekends.
和你一起做一些运动
周末。

17:49.517 --> 17:51.137
I got diarrhea.
我腹泻了。

17:55.000 --> 17:55.896
Huh?
啊？

17:56.000 --> 17:58.448
Are you Flats's Dad?
你是弗拉茨的爸爸吗？

17:58.551 --> 17:59.862
Why, yes, I am.
为什么，是的，我是。

17:59.965 --> 18:00.965
Okay, see...
好吧，看...

18:01.034 --> 18:02.314
I didn't know
where else to turn!
我不知道
还有哪里可以转！

18:02.413 --> 18:03.413
Patrick couldn't help me
帕特里克无法帮助我

18:03.448 --> 18:04.931
and Mrs. Puff
only made it worse!
和普芙夫人
只会让事情变得更糟！

18:05.034 --> 18:07.034
I sit next to your son
Flats in school
我坐在你儿子旁边
学校里的公寓

18:07.137 --> 18:08.257
and he is a fine boy and all
他是一个好男孩

18:08.310 --> 18:10.793
and I don't want you
to take this the wrong way
我不想要你
采取错误的方式

18:10.896 --> 18:12.310
but he wants to kick my butt.
但他想踢我的屁股。

18:12.413 --> 18:13.827
Dad, what are you doing?
爸爸，你在做什么？

18:13.931 --> 18:14.931
Uh, nothing, son.
呃，没什么，儿子。

18:15.034 --> 18:16.068
What did I tell you
我告诉你什么了

18:16.172 --> 18:17.000
about talking to strangers?
关于和陌生人说话？

18:17.103 --> 18:21.068
Now he's going to kick mybutt.
现在他要踢我的屁股了。

18:21.172 --> 18:24.896
Aah...!
啊啊……！

18:25.000 --> 18:26.758
Out of my way! Out of my way!
别挡我的路！别挡我的路！

18:26.862 --> 18:30.310
Can't you see
he's going to kick my butt?!
你看不到吗
他要踢我的屁股吗？

18:31.862 --> 18:33.862
Hi there, young people!
嗨，年轻人！

18:33.965 --> 18:34.965
Nice day today.
今天是美好的一天。

18:35.000 --> 18:37.310
So you like kickin'
butts, do ya?
所以你喜欢踢
屁股，是吗？

18:37.413 --> 18:39.206
Well, we'll show you, old man.
好吧，我们会告诉你，老伙计。

18:46.379 --> 18:47.689
Okay, okay, I got to skip town!
好吧，好吧，我得逃城了！

18:47.793 --> 18:50.241
Start a new life!
Live under an assumed name!
开始新的生活！
以化名生活！

18:50.344 --> 18:52.517
BobPants SpongeSquare!
Yeah, that's good.
BobPants 海绵方形！
是的，那很好。

18:52.620 --> 18:54.896
Grow a beard
and then shave it off....
留胡子
然后把它剃掉......

18:55.000 --> 18:56.413
and live happily ever after.
从此过上幸福的生活。

18:56.517 --> 18:58.310
Yeah, except you forgot the part
是的，除非你忘记了这个部分

18:58.413 --> 18:59.586
where I kick your butt!
我在那里踢你的屁股！

19:15.896 --> 19:17.344
Whoa...!
哇...！

19:22.758 --> 19:23.758
Hey, Flats.
嘿，平底鞋。

19:23.793 --> 19:25.689
You feeling better?
你感觉好些了吗？

19:25.793 --> 19:29.758
Wh-wh-hat? Where am I?
什-什-帽子？我在哪里？

19:29.862 --> 19:31.137
Why, you're in the hospital.
为什么，你在医院。

19:31.241 --> 19:32.251
This young boy saved your life.
这个小男孩救了你的命。

19:32.275 --> 19:34.931
He performed CPR
for five hours straight.
他进行了心肺复苏术
连续五个小时。

19:35.034 --> 19:37.965
Yeah... they said you'd be okay
after the first few minutes
是的...他们说你会没事的
最初几分钟后

19:38.068 --> 19:40.620
but I just wanted to be sure.
但我只是想确定一下。

19:40.724 --> 19:42.310
Wow! I'm touched.
哇！我很感动。

19:42.413 --> 19:45.620
I'll have to remember that
when I'm kicking your butt.
我必须记住这一点
当我踢你的屁股时。

19:46.068 --> 19:47.655
Those flowers for me?
那些花是给我的？

19:47.758 --> 19:49.068
Aah...!
啊啊……！

19:49.172 --> 19:52.103
He's still gonna kick my butt!
他还是要踢我的屁股！

19:52.206 --> 19:54.000
How many times do we have to
我们要经历多少次

19:54.103 --> 19:56.344
teach you this lesson, old man?
教你这个教训吗，老家伙？

19:56.448 --> 19:58.103
I love the young people.
我爱年轻人。

20:01.862 --> 20:03.620
Aah...!
啊啊……！

20:03.724 --> 20:06.724
Oh Gary! I'm too young
to have my butt kicked.
哦加里！我还太年轻
让我的屁股被踢。

20:06.827 --> 20:11.862
There are so many things in life
that I haven't gotten to do!
生活中有很多事情
我还没来得及做！

20:11.965 --> 20:14.310
Hang on...
I'll transfer your call.
坚持住...
我会转接你的电话。

20:15.655 --> 20:17.206
Who is it?
是谁？

20:18.586 --> 20:19.793
Aah...! Flats!
啊啊……！公寓！

20:19.896 --> 20:22.172
It's butt-kicking time.
又到了踢屁股的时间了

20:22.275 --> 20:24.103
Gary, there's something
I want you to know.
加里，有件事
我想让你知道。

20:24.206 --> 20:26.172
But I'm too scared
to remember what it is.
但我太害怕了
记住它是什么。

20:39.724 --> 20:40.931
Let's do it.
我们开始做吧。

20:41.034 --> 20:42.275
Go away, Gary.
走开，加里。

20:42.379 --> 20:45.379
I don't want you to see this,
it'll be ugly.
我不想让你看到这个
会很丑。

20:46.896 --> 20:48.068
Are you ready?
你准备好了吗？

20:48.172 --> 20:49.517
Hold on.
坚持，稍等。

20:50.758 --> 20:52.793
Okay, I'm ready.
好的，我准备好了。

20:58.344 --> 20:59.758
I said, I'm ready.
我说，我准备好了。

20:59.862 --> 21:00.862
Huh?
啊？

21:04.241 --> 21:05.344
Didn't you hear me?
你没听到我说话吗？

21:05.448 --> 21:06.448
I said I'm ready.
我说我准备好了。

21:08.413 --> 21:10.551
That tickled!
那个痒痒的！

21:18.586 --> 21:20.482
Gary! I'm absorbing
his blows
加里！我正在吸收
他的打击

21:20.586 --> 21:24.310
like I was made of some
kind of spongy material!
就像我是由一些组成的
一种海绵状材料！

21:24.413 --> 21:26.620
And do you know what that means?
你知道这意味着什么吗？

21:26.724 --> 21:29.068
I get to go to work tomorrow!
明天我还要去上班！

21:32.103 --> 21:33.586
Do you have any sevens?
你有七人吗？

22:00.379 --> 22:01.379
Flats? Are you okay?
公寓？你还好吗？

22:04.517 --> 22:07.551
Do not cheer me, my
fellow adult classmates.
别为我欢呼，我的
成年同学。

22:07.655 --> 22:09.965
Flats was the real victim here.
公寓是这里真正的受害者。

22:10.068 --> 22:11.344
A victim of a society
社会的受害者

22:11.448 --> 22:14.655
that's riding down
a violent road to nowhere...
那是下降的
一条通往无处可去的暴力之路……

22:14.758 --> 22:17.344
a road I call "Violence Road."
一条我称之为“暴力之路”的路。

22:17.448 --> 22:18.827
Sorry I'm late, class.
抱歉我迟到了，同学们。

22:18.931 --> 22:20.931
I...
我...

22:22.758 --> 22:24.103
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

22:24.206 --> 22:27.724
I can't believe
you beat up a new student!
我不敢相信
你殴打了一个新学生！

22:27.827 --> 22:31.793
I'm going to kick your butt!
我要踢你的屁股！

